      "created_at": "2021-06-18T16:52:29.116Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/4/40e34fa435be6d8db83c9595207e17faba0d06bc.png\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">\n      <a href=\"https://store.greaterthangames.com/replacement-card.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Greater Than Games</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"\" height=\"\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://store.greaterthangames.com/replacement-card.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Replacement Card</a></h3>\n\n<p>Order a replacement of any card from any of our games.Be sure to fill out the below fields or we will not be able to process this order.Only put one card per order. For an additional card, purchase another copy of this item with the fields filled out...</p>\n\n  <p><span class=\"label1\">Price: USD 0.95</span>\n    </p>\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>It seems unlikely to me that they’ll stop supporting the Enhanced Edition in favour of the Definitive Edition, at least not until all of it is out.</p>\n<p>Hope this helps, and welcome to the Forums, <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ladylagsalot\">@LadyLagsalot</a>!</p>",
